AArch64 SB+rel
(* The NON-fix: a store-RELEASE (STLR, what Volatile.Write emits on AArch64)
 * instead of a full barrier. Release only orders accesses BEFORE the store; it
 * does NOT order the store before a LATER load. So the StoreLoad window is
 * still open: ARM's official model says the `exists` outcome is ALLOWED. This
 * is the formal proof that `volatile` / release is NOT a fix for this bug. *)
{
0:X1=x; 0:X3=y;
1:X1=y; 1:X3=x;
}
 P0           | P1           ;
 MOV W0,#1    | MOV W0,#1    ;
 STLR W0,[X1] | STLR W0,[X1] ;
 LDR W2,[X3]  | LDR W2,[X3]  ;
exists
(0:X2=0 /\ 1:X2=0)
